and Pixar.

00:03:36.915 --> 00:03:39.084
Families in quarantine
heard it and were like,

00:03:39.084 --> 00:03:42.054
"Where the hell was this
ten months ago?! Come on!"

00:03:42.054 --> 00:03:44.390
When the news broke,
Netflix was like,

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.427
